PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52XC

   1 a 0000 E52XC: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-11 probe XC (PLAN H-C): LOAN2:54+99
   3 a 0006       mirror -- title('$con') print pagesize(0) open
   4 a 0006       (E52TB block, w1 2E52) then a bare file PAGE. */
